      <data key="d13">Edgar,_King_of_England</data>
      <data key="d14">{{Short description|King of the English from 959 to 975}}
{{Featured article}}
{{Use Oxford spelling|date=June 2024}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=October 2024}}
{{Infobox royalty
| image        = Edgar - MS Royal 14 B VI.jpg
| name         = Edgar
| caption      = Edgar in the early fourteenth-century {{awrap|''Genealogical Roll of the Kings of England''}}
| succession   = [[King of the English]]
| reign        = 1 October 959 – 8 July 975
